{
    "id":  26473,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Solar LED Street Light Kit GardenSun 240 2800Lm | BT Audio + Remote Control + 2.5m Aluminum Pole | 3CCT",
    "reference":  "KIT-91563",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eGardenSun 240W SMD7530 Solar LED Street Light + 2.5 Meter Aluminum Pole Kit\u003c/strong\u003e combines outdoor solar lighting and multifunctional technology. Up to \u003cstrong\u003e2800 lumens\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong\u003eselectable 3CCT (3000K/4000K/6500K)\u003c/strong\u003e. Incorporates \u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Audio with dual speaker\u003c/strong\u003e, remote control, USB/Type-C Power Bank, and \u003cstrong\u003e20,000 mAh\u003c/strong\u003e battery with up to \u003cstrong\u003e14 hours autonomy\u003c/strong\u003e. Kit includes resistant \u003cstrong\u003e2.5m modular aluminum pole\u003c/strong\u003e. \u003cstrong\u003eIP65\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eGardenSun Solar LED Street Light Kit 240 2800Lm | BT Audio + Remote Control + 2.5m Aluminium Pole | 3CCT IP65\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eGardenSun 240W Solar LED Street Light Kit with 2.5 Metre Modular Aluminium Pole\u003c/strong\u003e is a complete outdoor solar lighting solution designed to combine light output, multi-function technology and maximum energy efficiency in a single system. Ideal for autonomously illuminating gardens, patios, terraces, plots and outdoor spaces without any electrical installation.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eGardenSun 240W Solar LED Streetlight\u003c/strong\u003e features high-efficiency \u003cstrong\u003eSMD7530\u003c/strong\u003e LED technology and a \u003cstrong\u003eselectable 3CCT system\u003c/strong\u003e, allowing you to choose between three colour temperatures: \u003cstrong\u003e3000K warm light\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003e4000K neutral light\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e6500K cool light\u003c/strong\u003e. With up to \u003cstrong\u003e2800 lumens\u003c/strong\u003e, it provides uniform, powerful and comfortable lighting for all types of outdoor environments.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne of the great differentials of this solar LED streetlight is its integrated multimedia system. It includes \u003cstrong\u003etwo high-quality speakers with Bluetooth Audio\u003c/strong\u003e, ideal for streaming music directly from your mobile. It also features a \u003cstrong\u003eremote control\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003eLED status indicator\u003c/strong\u003e and a practical \u003cstrong\u003ePower Bank with USB and Type-C ports\u003c/strong\u003e for charging electronic devices outdoors.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe solar system consists of an efficient \u003cstrong\u003e25W 5V monocrystalline solar panel\u003c/strong\u003e and a high-capacity rechargeable \u003cstrong\u003e20,000 mAh\u003c/strong\u003e lithium battery, providing between \u003cstrong\u003e12 and 14 hours of autonomy\u003c/strong\u003e throughout the night.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe streetlight features an \u003cstrong\u003eadjustable tilting design\u003c/strong\u003e, allowing easy orientation of the light. Its \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-resistance ABS\u003c/strong\u003e construction and \u003cstrong\u003eIP65 waterproof and dustproof\u003c/strong\u003e protection guarantee maximum durability all year round.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe kit includes a sturdy \u003cstrong\u003e2.5-metre modular aluminium pole\u003c/strong\u003e made of \u003cstrong\u003e6 pieces of 450 mm\u003c/strong\u003e with an integrated \u003cstrong\u003ewater tank\u003c/strong\u003e for greater stability. Its \u003cstrong\u003eØ58 mm diameter tube\u003c/strong\u003e ensures perfect compatibility with the GardenSun range.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eRecommended applications\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eGardenSun 240W Kit\u003c/strong\u003e is ideal for:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGardens and terraces\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlots and rural estates\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePatios and chill-out areas\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHome entrances and garages\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePaths and walkways\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSwimming pools and recreational areas\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCampsites and outdoor events\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAreas without electrical access\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDecorative and leisure spaces\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAmbient and security lighting\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant:\u003c/strong\u003e the solar streetlight and modular pole \u003cstrong\u003eare delivered separately\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\n\n\u003c/p\u003e",
